<h2>Server stopped unexpectedly</h2>
<p>"{{serverName}}" stopped on its own{{#if exitCode}} (exit code {{exitCode}}){{/if}}.</p>
{{#if reason}}
  <p>Last console line: <code>{{reason}}</code></p>
{{/if}}
<p>{{#if serverName}}<strong>Server:</strong> {{serverName}}<br />{{/if}}{{#if nodeName}}<strong
    >Node:</strong>
    {{nodeName}}<br />{{/if}}<strong>Occurred at:</strong>
  {{occurredAt}}</p>